@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

title SD-05 - Archive a skill offer
actor "Student" as Student
boundary ":SkillController" as Controller
control ":ListingService" as Service
participant ":SkillListing\nRepository" as Listings
participant "listing:SkillListing" as Listing

Student -> Controller: archive(listingId)
Controller -> Service: archive(currentStudentId, listingId)
Service -> Listings: findByIdForUpdate(listingId)
Listings --> Service: current listing + owner / not found

Service -> Service: check listing ownership
alt missing listing or unauthorized
Service --> Controller: reject; no change
Controller --> Student: unavailable or access denied
else owned listing already inactive
Service --> Controller: already archived; no save
Controller --> Student: current archived status
else owned listing active
Service -> Listing: archive()
Service -> Listings: save(listing)
Listings --> Service: saved listing
Service --> Controller: archived (after commit)
Controller --> Student: redirect to own listings
end

' One service transaction holds the write lock until commit/rollback.
' currentStudentId comes from login. archive() sets active=false and retains requests.
' Lock/save/commit failures roll back and return a retry message instead of success.
@enduml
